sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Etudiant
    participant UI as UI Django (etudiant_examen_detail)
    participant Auth as Controle Auth/Role
    participant Ser as SoumissionSerializer
    participant DB as Base de donnees
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant CI as Pipeline CI/CD
    participant WH as API Webhook Resultats
    actor Enseignant

    Etudiant->>UI: Ouvre examen puis POST code_source
    UI->>Auth: verifier session + role ETUDIANT
    Auth-->>UI: ok
    UI->>DB: charger examen actif autorise pour user
    DB-->>UI: examen

    UI->>Ser: validate(payload, request.user)
    Ser->>DB: verifier appartenance groupe autorise
    Ser->>DB: verifier plage horaire examen
    Ser->>DB: verifier unicite soumission (examen, etudiant)

    alt Validation metier KO
        Ser-->>UI: erreurs metier
        UI-->>Etudiant: message erreur detaille
    else Validation metier OK
        Ser-->>UI: donnees valides
        UI->>DB: create Soumission(statut=EN_TEST)
        DB-->>UI: soumission id + trace_id
        UI->>GH: create/update Main.java + metadata.json

        alt Push GitHub KO
            GH-->>UI: erreur API
            UI->>DB: delete Soumission
            UI-->>Etudiant: soumission annulee
        else Push GitHub OK
            GH-->>UI: repo_url + commit_sha
            UI->>DB: update Soumission(url_depot_git, hash_commit)
            UI-->>Etudiant: soumission en test

            CI->>GH: clone repo solutions + tests
            CI->>CI: build + run tests
            CI->>WH: POST /api/webhook/resultats/ + X-API-TOKEN

            WH->>WH: verifier token
            alt Token invalide
                WH-->>CI: 403 Forbidden
            else Token valide
                WH->>DB: update_or_create Resultat(note, feedback)
                WH->>DB: update Soumission.statut(CORRIGE|ECHEC)
                WH-->>CI: 200/201 OK
            end
        end
    end

    Etudiant->>UI: consulte /etudiant/resultats/
    UI->>DB: select Resultat by soumission__etudiant
    DB-->>UI: liste resultats
    UI-->>Etudiant: affichage note + feedback

    Enseignant->>UI: consulte /enseignant/resultats/
    UI->>DB: select Resultat by examens enseignant
    DB-->>UI: liste resultats filtres
    UI-->>Enseignant: suivi corrections
